WEBVTT

00:00:00.727 --> 00:00:05.928
Every product page is a chance to help shoppers discover products that make sense together.

00:00:08.091 --> 00:00:16.594
AI Commerce Copilot brings those recommendations into WooCommerce, where shoppers choose what they want and add the bundle in one step.

00:00:20.364 --> 00:00:21.839
That's what the shopper sees.

00:00:23.182 --> 00:00:27.036
AI Commerce Copilot gives the merchant the system behind it.

00:00:28.545 --> 00:00:33.287
For learned relationships, you can see the purchase evidence behind the recommendation.

00:00:35.818 --> 00:00:42.557
And when a product does not have enough purchase history yet, catalog signals can keep useful recommendations available.

00:00:44.636 --> 00:00:47.831
And the merchant is not locked into the automatic result.

00:00:51.091 --> 00:00:56.765
When your merchandising strategy calls for something different, you can shape the recommendation yourself.

00:01:00.636 --> 00:01:03.655
The same product page now reflects that decision.

00:01:06.455 --> 00:01:16.237
The dashboard turns recommendation activity into something the merchant can work with: engagement, product relationships, and opportunities worth a closer look.

00:01:18.455 --> 00:01:24.634
Reco helps make that data easier to act on, guiding the merchant toward what deserves attention next.

00:01:26.273 --> 00:01:30.763
AI Commerce Copilot works alongside WooCommerce, not in place of it.

00:01:31.182 --> 00:01:37.335
Your checkout stays WooCommerce, and your store keeps selling if the recommendation service is unavailable.

00:01:38.727 --> 00:01:42.675
Smarter recommendations. Merchant insight. Practical control.

00:01:43.545 --> 00:01:46.938
AI Commerce Copilot. Available for WooCommerce.

